Sources of text and code copied or ported into this repo. Each source is one entry (a block with no blank line inside); a file
that carries a `copied-from: <source> <path> @<commit>` header needs the source and that commit in the same entry, and
tests/test_notice.py fails when it does not. Sources a file only read for its shape carry a `referent:` header instead; those that
also lent text are named below.

